## Agents

Use `claude --agent <name>` to invoke a specialized agent.

| Agent | Model | Role |
|-------|-------|------|
| `developer` | opus | Senior engineer — implements features, fixes bugs, writes code |
| `tester` | sonnet | QA engineer — writes tests, validates implementations, runs checks |
| `reviewer` | sonnet | Adversarial reviewer — read-only code review, quality gate |
| `strategist` | opus | Product strategist and architecture advisor — research, design decisions, ADRs |
| `manager` | opus | Orchestrator — breaks tasks, spawns strategist/dev/test/review pipeline |

