## Skills

Use `/skill-name` to invoke a skill.

| Skill | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `/continue` | Resume previous session — reads context, picks up work |
| `/commit` | Smart commit — pre-flight checks + conventional commit |
| `/audit` | Verify context files against ground truth |
| `/doublecheck` | Adversarial verification of implementation correctness |
| `/fix` | Auto-fix safe items from audit report |
| `/issue` | Create GitHub issues with conventions |

